# Scene2-2-3

; ●シーン2‐2‐3

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_22_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天早上。|#0202Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一睁开眼我就立刻坐起身，<br>翻身下床。|#0202Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来艾玛还没醒。<br>我悄悄松了口气。|#0202Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（和面都不想见的人同居一室，<br>　实在太令人窒息）|#0202Adv03_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 牢の施錠音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@StopSfx

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; 牢の扉が開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_119 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:我掐准牢房的开锁时间，走出房门。<br>我已经决定好，今天要从一大早就开始探索监牢。|#0202Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我要杀了艾玛。<br>　为此需要制定一个正确的计划）|#0202Adv03_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到处走一走看一看，<br>说不定就能想到些好办法。|#0202Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SetCustomVariable Expression:"chosenAreaFlag = 0"
